[00:19.39]1. Signs of the times are pointing to the Kingdom.
[00:24.03]Good news we tell for all to hear.
[00:29.08]Lift up your heads, and look to your salvation;
[00:33.76]Time for deliverance is near!
[00:35.90](Chorus)
[00:38.04]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[00:42.80]Sing loud, and raise a joyful cry.
[00:47.64]Rejoice in the hope, and show a grateful heart,
[00:52.99]All give praise and laud our God on high.
[00:57.19]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[01:01.99]His greatness all must come to know.
[01:06.99]With constant devotion to our God and King,
[01:11.99]Godly joy in service we will show.
[01:14.69]2. Look to our God, you lovers of Jehovah.
[01:17.40]No need to fear, for he is strong.
[01:20.10]Stand up and shout with voices loud as thunder;
[01:22.81]Sing to our God a joyful song!
[01:25.51](Chorus)
[01:28.22]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[01:33.28]Sing loud, and raise a joyful cry.
[01:38.33]Rejoice in the hope, and show a grateful heart,
[01:43.39]All give praise and laud our God on high.
[01:48.44]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[02:08.67]His greatness all must come to know.
[02:13.67]With constant devotion to our God and King,
[02:18.67]Godly joy in service we will show.